    "title": "Golden State Gun Deaths Plunge To 50-Year Low, But Bonta Tells Lawmakers Not To Spike The Football - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah Hernandez ,\n13 hours ago California saw its lowest number of firearm-related deaths in more than half a century in 2024, the fewest since 1968, Attorney General Rob Bonta announced Tuesday. The drop also pushed the statewide homicide rate down toward historic lows, a shift Bonta cast as a major public-safety win even as he warned that the trend could reverse without steady investment in prevention. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 27",
